                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Mid-Year Sale drive?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% of Q3 revenue for participating categories. Consumer electronics + home peak higher (25-40%).</p>
                                        <h3>How do I prepare for Amazon Prime Day?</h3>
                                        <p>Inventory 8-12 weeks ahead + creative + campaigns 4-6 weeks ahead + coordination with Amazon account managers. Late preparation misses opportunity.</p>
                                        <h3>Should India brands invest heavily in Flipkart Mid-Year?</h3>
                                        <p>For marketplace-heavy brands (electronics, fashion, home): yes. Flipkart Mid-Year Sale drives 20-40% of Flipkart annual volume for participating brands.</p>
                                        <h3>Is monsoon-focused marketing worthwhile India?</h3>
